      "neuro_symbolic_scientific_discovery": "Problem: Autonomous scientific agents frequently suffer from catastrophic forgetting and confirmation bias during long-horizon computational experiments, failing to systematically dampen falsified hypotheses or preserve mathematical guarantees across multi-variable physical and biological simulations. Approach: Leveraging Google Antigravity's parallel agentic workflows, Gemini 4 Argon, and the Google DeepMind Science Skills ecosystem, we integrate Vivy.v6's deterministic Rust C-ABI engine (Jacobi SVD spectral analysis, Max-Sum Belief Propagation factor-graph optimization, VM-11 falsification dampening, and Rank-1 Sherman-Morrison RLS + Fisher EWC open-ended neurogenesis) to orchestrate grounded, reproducible dry-lab discovery across structural biology and computational science benchmarks. Deliverables: Over the next 6-12 months, we will publish open-source Apache-2.0 scientific verification harnesses, full-weight 3B specialized models (Vivy-R-Series), and reproducible multi-domain scientific discovery benchmarks at https://github.com/ngocchau-ai/ViVy."
